      "evidence_char_start": 6976,
      "evidence_char_end": 7372,
      "evidence_text": "Q: Can you take famotidine long term? A: Famotidine (brand name: Pepcid AC, Zantac 360) should not be used for longer than 14 days if you are treating heartburn symptoms. Famotidine may be used for a longer period under the direction of your healthcare provider for treatment of intestinal or stomach ulcers, gastroesophageal reflux (GERD), erosive esophagitis, or other acid-related conditions.\n",
